# Steps to install SASS (on Windows using VS Code terminal)

1. Downloaded and installed Node.js (which includes npm) from:
   https://nodejs.org/en/download

2. Verified the installation:
   > node -v
   > npm -v

3. Installed SASS globally using npm:
   > npm install -g sass@3.7.4

4. Verified SASS installation:
   > sass --version
